---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Olá, sou o Vini.</h1>
  <p>Desenvolvedor. Aqui ficam meus projetos e o que ando escrevendo.</p>
  <a class="button" href="https://github.com/vinibeloni">GitHub</a>
</section>

<h2 id="projetos">Projetos</h2>
<div class="grid">
  {% for p in projects %}
  <a class="card" href="{{ p.url }}">
    {% if p.image %}<img src="{{ p.image }}" alt="">{% endif %}
    <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ p.description }}</p>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 id="posts">Posts recentes</h2>
<ul class="posts">
  {% for post in collections.post | reverse %}
  <li><time class="muted">{{ post.date | date }}</time> <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></li>
  {% else %}
  <li class="muted">Nenhum post ainda.</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
